  "Example: Software engineering jobs in Manchester above GBP 60k. Prefer backend/API work, hybrid or remote roles, and visa-friendly employers. Lower-score generic graduate programmes.": "例如：曼彻斯特年薪 6 万英镑以上的软件工程岗位。优先后端/API 方向，接受混合办公或远程，偏好提供签证支持的雇主，降低泛泛的校招项目的评分。",
