  "Visa-friendly roles": "提供签证支持的职位",
  "Masters placement roles in software engineering, data, or QA. Prefer Manchester, Sheffield, Leeds, or remote. Visa-friendly is important. Avoid unpaid roles.": "软件工程、数据或测试方向的硕士实习岗位。优先曼彻斯特、谢菲尔德、利兹或远程，签证支持很重要，避开无薪岗位。",
  "Graduate software engineering jobs in Manchester above GBP 60k. Surface backend/API roles, lower-score generic graduate programmes, and prefer hybrid or remote options.": "曼彻斯特年薪 6 万英镑以上的应届软件工程岗位。优先展示后端/API 岗位，降低泛泛校招项目的评分，倾向混合办公或远程。",
  "Data analyst internships in the UK. Prefer paid roles using SQL, Python, or dashboards. Rank remote-friendly and visa-friendly employers higher.": "英国的数据分析实习。优先使用 SQL、Python 或仪表盘的有薪岗位，远程友好和提供签证支持的雇主排名更靠前。",
  "Software roles from visa-friendly employers. Prioritize backend TypeScript, platform engineering, or API work. Avoid unpaid roles and roles below GBP 45k.": "来自提供签证支持的雇主的软件岗位。优先后端 TypeScript、平台工程或 API 方向，避开无薪岗位和年薪低于 4.5 万英镑的岗位。",
